  "result": "Perfect! All 44 tests pass. I've added two line management functions to `src/invoices.js`:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 adds or updates a line on a draft invoice\n- If SKU doesn't exist, adds a new line at the end (enriched from catalogue)\n- If SKU exists, increases that line's qty\n- Validates qty (QTY_INVALID) and SKU (UNKNOWN_SKU) like `createInvoice`\n- Refuses if invoice status isn't 'draft' (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)`, never mutates original\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 removes a line from a draft invoice\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with that line removed\n- Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU not on invoice\n- Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the last line\n- Refuses if invoice status isn't 'draft' (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Never mutates original\n\nAdded two new error codes to `src/errors.js`:\n- NOT_DRAFT\n- LINE_NOT_FOUND\n\nAdded 15 comprehensive tests covering all functionality, validation, error cases, and input immutability.",
